+        # 也可以设置 unmanaged-devices, 但是官方文档不推荐
+        # https://networkmanager.pages.freedesktop.org/NetworkManager/NetworkManager/NetworkManager.conf.html#:~:text=may%20be%20a-,better%20choice,-.
+    done
+}
